Z||000012||Shaun41178||11-27-2000||10:15 AM||||Yea polluck I second that emotion.  For every street race story posted here there is always at least one that makes a comment of how we shouldn't do it.  that gets annoying and no I am not singling anybody out its just that it happens and i personally don't want to see it as it won't change my mind about streetracing.  I am not even going to argue any points here and just say that i think we need a street racing link of some sort here on Pennocks.<P>i also think we need a new one for engine conversations as there are like new 3.4 questions asked every 2-3 days it seems or 3.1 engines or aluminum head engines or what not.  they need to all be in the same place for quick reference or just start directing people to use the Search function more often                                                ||||reg||1
